# Lens profiles.
lens_profiles.invalid = Londa database ya Lensfun v1/v2 XML entuufu (okutuuka ku 8 MiB) nga erina data ya camera oba lens ewagirwa.
lens_profiles.calibration = Okupima lenzi
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Tewali kupima kubikka ku nteekateeka zino. Kebera obuwanvu bw’ekifo n’ensonga y’ebirime bya kkamera; okutereeza mu ngalo kukyaliwo.
lens_profiles.import = Yingiza Lensfun XML...
lens_profiles.imported = Lensfun database eyingiziddwa olw'olutuula luno. Londa profile oba kwataganya metadata y'ekifaananyi.
lens_profiles.manual = Okutereeza mu ngalo kwokka
lens_profiles.saved = Okupima okuterekeddwa (database teriiwo) .
lens_profiles.profile = Ebifaananyi bya lenzi
lens_profiles.aperture = Aperture (0 = temanyiddwa) .
lens_profiles.distance = Ebanga ly’okussa essira (0 = temanyiddwa) .
lens_profiles.vignette = Okukola vignetting ezipimiddwa
lens_profiles.color_context = Calibrated vignetting yeetaaga sRGB profile ezimbiddwamu. Kyuusa mu sRGB okukuuma endabika, olwo oddemu okuggulawo Okutereeza lenzi. Ku pixels ezitali za sRGB edda, okugabanya sRGB kimala. Geometry ne chromatic correction bikyaliwo.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Tewali vignetting calibration ebikka aperture ne focus distance. Yingiza emiwendo egypimiddwa okugisobozesa; 1000 m ekiikirira okussa essira ery’ewala mu bifaananyi bingi ebya Lensfun.
lens_profiles.note = Okutereeza okupimiddwa kudduka nga tekunnaba kufuga mu ngalo. Kozesa fuleemu enzijuvu eyasooka; oluvannyuma salako ekifaananyi. Teeka omugogo gw'omusengejja mu PSD/PSB okukuuma okupima okulongoosebwa.
lens_profiles.automatic = Okukwataganya metadata y'ebifaananyi
lens_profiles.components = Profile: okukyusakyusa {distortion}; langi eziriko enviiri {tca}; okukola vignetting {vignette}.
